# Who must review what. With one person this file changes nothing: GitHub
# does not let the author of a pull request approve it. It starts to matter
# when a second person joins and branch protection requires a code owner's
# review. Until then the paths below are a reading list: changes under them
# are read line by line (docs/process/workflow.md, Phase 6).
#
# Replace the examples with the project's real paths and uncomment.

# The harness itself
# /.claude/        @owner
# /.github/        @owner
# /CLAUDE.md       @owner

# Security-sensitive code (examples; use the project's real paths)
# /app/**/crypto/     @owner
# /app/**/security/   @owner
